<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 Lower. Demand was moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  49.50-51.00 Few 49.00 &amp; 51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  44.00-49.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  39.00-44.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $0.50. Top $48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.50-42.00 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 41.00-43.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 44.00-46.00 Few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>47.00-48.00</p>
